3. **Stats bar**: 3 big tabular-nums stats (bots built, backtests run, community presets) that count up on scroll.
4. **How it works, 4 steps**: Pick your layers → Connect them on the canvas → Backtest instantly → Save, share, or go live  pinned scroll section per §4.
