## 11. Quality floor  non-negotiable across every page

- Fully responsive down to mobile for every marketing/dashboard/account/billing page. The Builder canvas is desktop-primary (like a pro creative tool)  on small screens show a clean "Best experienced on a larger screen" state rather than a broken cramped canvas.
- Visible keyboard focus states everywhere (glass-appropriate focus ring, not a browser-default blue outline that clashes with the theme).
- `prefers-reduced-motion` respected everywhere per §4.
- Color contrast checked especially on glass surfaces  text must stay legible over blur.
- Every icon-only button has an `aria-label`. Every form field has a real label. Modals trap focus and are dismissible via `Escape`.

