## 13. Explicit non-goals for this build

Do **not** implement: real authentication/JWT/sessions, a real database or persistence beyond `localStorage`, the real Razorpay SDK/live keys, real backtesting computation or real market/news data feeds, real websockets to any exchange, real email sending, real 2FA/OTP delivery, real file storage for avatars/exports (client-side preview / fake download is enough). All of that comes later, once this frontend is approved. Your only job right now is to make every page above look and feel completely real, fully clickable, and true to the Apple-glass design language.